#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/tools_menu.rst:1
msgid "The tools menu in Krita."
msgstr "Meni z orodji v Kriti."

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/tools_menu.rst:11
msgid "Macro"
msgstr "Makro"

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/tools_menu.rst:11
msgid "Scripts"
msgstr "Skripti"

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/tools_menu.rst:17
msgid "Tools Menu"
msgstr "Meni Orodja"

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/tools_menu.rst:19
msgid "This contains three things."
msgstr "To vsebuje tri stvari."

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/tools_menu.rst:22
msgid "Scripting"
msgstr "Skriptanje"

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/tools_menu.rst:24
msgid ""
"When you have python scripting enabled and have scripts toggled, this is "
"where most scripts are stored by default."
msgstr ""
"Ko imate omogočeno skriptanje v Pythonu in imate skripte vključene, je "
"večina skriptov privzeto shranjenih."

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/tools_menu.rst:27
msgid "Recording"
msgstr "Snemanje"

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/tools_menu.rst:28
#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/tools_menu.rst:35
msgid ""
"Macro recording and playing is disabled since 3.0 due to unmaintained code "
"and buggy behaviour leading to crash."
msgstr ""
"Snemanje in predvajanje makrov je onemogočeno od 3.0 zaradi nepovezane kode "
"in hroščastega vedenja, ki vodi v sesutja."

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/tools_menu.rst:31
msgid ""
"Record a macro. You do this by pressing start, drawing something and then "
"pressing stop. This feature can only record brush strokes. The resulting "
"file is stored as a \\*.kritarec file."
msgstr ""
"Posnemite makro. To naredite tako, da pritisnete začni, narišete nekaj in "
"nato pritisnete ustavi. Ta funkcija lahko posname samo poteze čopiča. "
"Nastala datoteka je shranjena kot datoteka \\*.kritarec."

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/tools_menu.rst:34
msgid "Macros"
msgstr "Makri"

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/tools_menu.rst:38
msgid ""
"Play back or edit a krita rec file. The edit can only change the brush "
"preset on strokes or add and remove filters."
msgstr ""
"Predvajajte ali uredite posneto datoteko Krite. Z urejanjem lahko spremenite "
"samo prednastavitve čopiča na potezah ali dodate oz. odstranite filtre."
